   "date": "2026-01-04",
   "text": "Grandad's cough is worse. Mum drove him to the GP this morning.",
   "cluster": "grandad"
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "date": "2026-01-04",
   "text": "The bins went out late again, foxes got into them"
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "date": "2026-01-19",
   "text": "Visited Grandad in the hospital. He told the nurses about his war medals.",
   "cluster": "grandad"
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "date": "2026-02-02",
   "text": "Grandad died last night, peacefully, with Mum holding his hand.",
   "cluster": "grandad"
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "date": "2026-02-02",
   "text": "Snow on the hills behind the station this morning"
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "date": "2026-02-10",
   "text": "The funeral. We played his favourite Glenn Miller record and everyone cried.",
   "cluster": "grandad"
  },
  {
   "id": 7,
   "date": "2026-03-15",
   "text": "Found his old pocket watch in the shed. Still ticks. Smells of his pipe.",
   "cluster": "grandad"
  },
  {
   "id": 8,
   "date": "2026-05-20",
   "text": "Grief caught me in the hardware store, the aisle where he bought his nails",
   "cluster": "grandad"
  },
  {
   "id": 9,
   "date": "2026-03-01",
   "text": "Booked flights to Lisbon for April! Five days, just me and Sam.",
   "cluster": "lisbon"
  },
  {
   "id": 10,
   "date": "2026-03-01",
   "text": "Lovely quiet Sunday, read most of a novel on the sofa"
  },
  {
   "id": 11,
   "date": "2026-04-10",
   "text": "Landed in Lisbon. The light on the tiles is unreal.",
   "cluster": "lisbon"
  },
  {
   "id": 12,
   "date": "2026-04-11",
   "text": "Rode tram 28 up to Alfama, Sam nearly fell off laughing",
   "cluster": "lisbon"
  },
  {
   "id": 13,
   "date": "2026-04-12",
   "text": "Pastel de nata still warm from the oven in Belém. Ate three.",
   "cluster": "lisbon"
  },
  {
   "id": 14,
   "date": "2026-04-12",
   "text": "Work emails piling up while I'm away, ignoring them"
  },
  {
   "id": 15,
   "date": "2026-04-15",
   "text": "Back from Lisbon. Unpacking sand and sardine tins.",
   "cluster": "lisbon"
  },
  {
